"checkbox\" id=\"\" disabled=\"\" class=\"task-list-item-checkbox\" aria-label=\"Incomplete task\"> Fits <a href=\"https://github.com/NixOS/nixpkgs/blob/master/CONTRIBUTING.md\">CONTRIBUTING.md</a>, <a href=\"https://github.com/NixOS/nixpkgs/blob/master/pkgs/README.md\">pkgs/README.md</a>, <a href=\"https://github.com/NixOS/nixpkgs/blob/master/maintainers/README.md\">maintainers/README.md</a> and other READMEs.</li>\n</ul>\n<hr>\n<p dir=\"auto\">Add a 👍 <a href=\"https://github.blog/2016-03-10-add-reactions-to-pull-requests-issues-and-comments/\" rel=\"nofollow\">reaction</a> to <a href=\"https://github.com/NixOS/nixpkgs/pulls?q=is%3Aopen+sort%3Areactions-%2B1-desc\">pull requests you find important</a>.</p>",
